          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="nav-item has-dropdown">
          <a href="/festivals" class="nav-cat"><span class="nav-label" data-hi="व्रत और उपवास">Vrat &amp; Upavas</span> <span class="nav-caret">▾</span></a>
